OL,3,C'A wildlife emergency': Hundreds of
OL,4,Cfish die in muddy pond
OL,6,FWildlife experts have warned people
OL,7,Fnot to dump unwanted fish in local
OL,8,Fponds after hundreds of suffocating
OL,9,Fgoldfish, carp and other species were
OL,10,Frescued from a hot mud-caked pool near
OL,11,FExeter.
OL,13,FHundreds more are thought to have died
OL,14,Fas volunteers fought to rescue the
OL,15,Ffloundering fish from the shallow
OL,16,Fwater of the pool at Poltimore.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
