OL,3,C'A wildlife emergency': Hundreds of
OL,4,Cfish die in muddy pond
OL,6,FThe summer's heatwave and drought have
OL,7,Fleft the pond dangerously short of
OL,8,Fwater, and while some of the fish were
OL,9,Frescued, many others were found dead
OL,10,Faround the parched edges of the pool.
OL,12,FIt is believed that much of the fish
OL,13,Fpopulation of the pool has come from
OL,14,Fpeople dumping unwanted pet fish in
OL,15,Fthe water. Those fish have bred,
OL,16,Fleading to a pond that is teeming with
OL,17,Fshoals of colourful fish including
OL,18,Fmirror carp and ghost carp.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
