OL,3,C'A wildlife emergency': Hundreds of
OL,4,Cfish die in muddy pond
OL,6,FAmong the volunteer rescuers was
OL,7,FExeter city councillor Alison Sheridan
OL,8,F(Reform, St Loyes), who said: "There
OL,9,Fwere dead fish all around the
OL,10,Fperimeter, and those fish that were in
OL,11,Fthe water were gasping for breath.
OL,12,FThey were caked in mud and it was
OL,13,Fincredibly hot."
OL,15,FRescuers called the Environment
OL,16,FAgency, saying the incident was a
OL,17,F'wildlife emergency', but no official
OL,18,Faction was taken.
OL,26,@pD@_OUuD@PO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
