CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786745066
OL,3,C'A wildlife emergency': Hundreds of
OL,4,Cfish die in muddy pond
OL,6,FCllr Sheridan, who waded in with her
OL,7,Fson Marcus to scoop up the fish, said:
OL,8,F"We missed the eclipse to save
OL,9,Fhundreds of fish ` carp, goldfish,
OL,10,Fperch and others ` that were
OL,11,Fsuffocating to death in the hot mud.
OL,13,F"Volunteers, families and some
OL,14,Fconstruction workers from the
OL,15,FGreendale Farm Shop were up to their
OL,16,Fthighs in thick mud saving well over
OL,17,F1,500 fish."
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOUyD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
