PN,40505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786745066
OL,3,C'A wildlife emergency': Hundreds of
OL,4,Cfish die in muddy pond
OL,6,FAfter more than four hours Cllr
OL,7,FSheridan and her son took home more
OL,8,Fthan 200 fish to recover in massive
OL,9,Ftanks in their garden, where they keep
OL,10,Ftheir own fish. Other people with fish
OL,11,Ftanks and ponds at home did the same.
OL,13,FShe added: "People were confused that
OL,14,Fthis wasn't being covered by the
OL,15,Fauthorities as it was a wildlife
OL,16,Femergency and around 50 ordinary
OL,17,Fpeople were helping or watching.
OL,26,@uD@LOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
