PN,40506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786745066
OL,3,C'A wildlife emergency': Hundreds of
OL,4,Cfish die in muddy pond
OL,6,F"It was a great team effort, but
OL,7,Fnothing 'official' was being done
OL,8,Fdespite notification to the relevant
OL,9,Fauthorities."
OL,11,FAn Environment Agency spokesperson
OL,12,Fsaid that droughts were taking a toll
OL,13,Fon watercourses and the wildlife that
OL,14,Finhabit them.
OL,16,F"We are putting all our efforts into
OL,17,Frescuing fish in distress in rivers
OL,18,Fand streams where there is little to
OL,19,Fno flow and high temperatures," the
OL,20,Fspokesperson added.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@MO]xD@AOU{D@_O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
