PN,40508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786745066
OL,3,C'A wildlife emergency': Hundreds of
OL,4,Cfish die in muddy pond
OL,6,F"We would remind people not to release
OL,7,Funwanted fish into ponds, lakes or
OL,8,Fother waterbodies," said the
OL,9,Fspokesperson. "Non-native fish can
OL,10,Fbreed and spread, disrupting local
OL,11,Fecosystems."
OL,13,FAnyone who sees a fish in distress can
OL,14,Freport it to the incident hotline on
OL,15,F0800 807060.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@SO]qD@OOUsD@LO]
